# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# PATCH /api/properties/{id}/status — Actualización de estado
# Reemplaza {propertyId} por un id real obtenido de GET /api/properties
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Escenario 1: Actualización exitosa de estado (200 OK)

PATCH {{RealtorApi_HostAddress}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"status": "Rented"
}

### Escenario 2: 404 Not Found — id inexistente

PATCH {{RealtorApi_HostAddress}}/api/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"status": "Available"
}

### Escenario 3: 400 Bad Request — status omitido

PATCH {{RealtorApi_HostAddress}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Escenario 4: 400 Bad Request — status inválido

PATCH {{RealtorApi_HostAddress}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"status": "Archived"
}

### Escenario 5: 400 Bad Request — propiedad JSON inesperada

PATCH {{RealtorApi_HostAddress}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"status": "Available",
	"extra": "no permitido"
}

### Escenario 6: 413 Payload Too Large — imagen mayor a 5 MB

PUT {{RealtorApi_HostAddress}}/api/properties/{{propertyId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UpdateProperty413

--UpdateProperty413
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Casa imagen grande actualización
--UpdateProperty413
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Imagen mayor a 5 MB en actualización
--UpdateProperty413
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

202 Big Image Ave
--UpdateProperty413
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

2500
--UpdateProperty413
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

Rented
--UpdateProperty413
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="large.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./large-image-over-5mb.png
--UpdateProperty413--

